DESCRIPTION:At Giannini Hall\, 36 photographs selected from the recently p
 ublished Remembering the Future: Nuclear Testing\, Rising Seas\, and The M
 arshall Islands (Radius Books\, © 2026) by Mark Klett and William L. Fox 
 extend the two men’s decades-long collaboration tracing the nuclear hist
 ory of the American West and the broader Pacific sphere.\nCategory: Exhibi
 ts\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.edu/live/events/330194-photo
 graphy-installation-remembering-the-future
